# Data Source: identitynow_identity_attribute

Use this data source to look up an identity attribute by its technical name.

## Example Usage

{{ tffile .ExampleFile }}

## Arguments Reference

* `name` - (Required) Technical name of the identity attribute.

## Attributes Reference

* `id` - Identity attribute ID, the same as `name`.
* `display_name` - Business-friendly name of the identity attribute.
* `type` - Type of the identity attribute.
* `standard` - Whether the attribute is a standard attribute.
* `multi` - Whether the attribute is multi-valued.
* `searchable` - Whether the attribute is searchable.
* `system` - Whether the attribute is a system attribute.
* `sources_json` - Sources of the attribute value as a JSON array.
